oting and Postgres connection string FAQs\",\"href\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/connecting-to-postgres#troubleshooting-and-postgres-connection-string-faqs\",\"content\":\"## Troubleshooting and Postgres connection string FAQs\\n\\nBelow are answers to common challenges and queries.\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Troubleshooting and Postgres connection string FAQs\",\"href\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/connecting-to-postgres#troubleshooting-and-postgres-connection-string-faqs\",\"content\":\"## Troubleshooting and Postgres connection string FAQs\\n\\nBelow are answers to common challenges and queries.\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Troubleshooting and Postgres connection string FAQs\",\"href\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/connecting-to-postgres#troubleshooting-and-postgres-connection-string-faqs\",\"content\":\"## Troubleshooting and Postgres connection string FAQs\\n\\nBelow are answers to common challenges and queries.\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Troubleshooting and Postgres connection string FAQs\",\"href\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/connecting-to-postgres#troubleshooting-and-postgres-connection-string-faqs\",\"content\":\"## Troubleshooting and Postgres connection string FAQs\\n\\nBelow are answers to common challenges and queries.\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Why do connection strings have different ports?\",\"href\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/connecting-to-postgres#why-do-connection-strings-have-different-ports\",\"content\":\"### Why do connection strings have different ports?\\n\\nDifferent modes use different ports:\\n\\n*   Direct connection: `5432` (Postgres on your project instance)\\n*   Dedicated pooler, transaction mode: `6543` (PgBouncer on your project instance)\\n*   Shared pooler, transaction mode: `6543` (Supavisor, multi-tenant)\\n*   Shared pooler, session mode: `5432` (Supavisor, multi-tenant)\\n\\nThe port helps route the connection to the right pooler/mode.\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Why do connection strings have different ports?\",\"href\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/connecting-to-postgres#why-do-connection-strings-have-different-ports\",\"content\":\"### Why do connection strings have different ports?\\n\\nDifferent modes use different ports:\\n\\n*   Direct connection: `5432` (Postgres on your project instance)\\n*   Dedicated pooler, transaction mode: `6543` (PgBouncer on your project instance)\\n*   Shared pooler, transaction mode: `6543` (Supavisor, multi-tenant)\\n*   Shared pooler, session mode: `5432` (Supavisor, multi-tenant)\\n\\nThe port helps route the connection to the right pooler/mode.\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Why do connection strings have different ports?\",\"href\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/connecting-to-postgres#why-do-connection-strings-have-different-ports\",\"content\":\"### Why do connection strings have different ports?\\n\\nDifferent modes use different ports:\\n\\n*   Direct connection: `5432` (Postgres on your project instance)\\n*   Dedicated pooler, transaction mode: `6543` (PgBouncer on your project instance)\\n*   Shared pooler, transaction mode: `6543` (Supavisor, multi-tenant)\\n*   Shared pooler, session mode: `5432` (Supavisor, multi-tenant)\\n\\nThe port helps route the connection to the right pooler/mode.\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Why do connection strings have different ports?\",\"href\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/connecting-to-postgres#why-do-connection-strings-have-different-ports\",\"content\":\"### Why do connection strings have different ports?\\n\\nDifferent modes use different ports:\\n\\n*   Direct connection: `5432` (Postgres on your project instance)\\n*   Dedicated pooler, transaction mode: `6543` (PgBouncer on your project instance)\\n*   Shared pooler, transaction mode: `6543` (Supavisor, multi-tenant)\\n*   Shared pooler, session mode: `5432` (Supavisor, multi-tenant)\\n\\nThe port helps route the connection to the right pooler/mode.\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Why do connection strings have