hen the app is idle?\",\"href\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/connecting-to-postgres#why-are-there-active-connections-when-the-app-is-idle\",\"content\":\"### Why are there active connections when the app is idle?\\n\\nEven if your application isn’t making queries, some Supabase services keep persistent connections to your database. For example, Storage, PostgREST, and our health checker all maintain long-lived connections. You usually see a small baseline of active connections from these services.\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Why are there active connections when the app is idle?\",\"href\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/connecting-to-postgres#why-are-there-active-connections-when-the-app-is-idle\",\"content\":\"### Why are there active connections when the app is idle?\\n\\nEven if your application isn’t making queries, some Supabase services keep persistent connections to your database. For example, Storage, PostgREST, and our health checker all maintain long-lived connections. You usually see a small baseline of active connections from these services.\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Why are there active connections when the app is idle?\",\"href\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/connecting-to-postgres#why-are-there-active-connections-when-the-app-is-idle\",\"content\":\"### Why are there active connections when the app is idle?\\n\\nEven if your application isn’t making queries, some Supabase services keep persistent connections to your database. For example, Storage, PostgREST, and our health checker all maintain long-lived connections. You usually see a small baseline of active connections from these services.\\n\"},{\"title\":\"Why are there active connections when the app is idle?\",\"href\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/connecting-to-postgres#why-are-there-active-connections-when-the-app-is-idle\",\"content\":\"### Why are there active connections when the app is idle?\\n\\nEven if your application isn’t making queries, some Su